		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Jet-black scales adorn this hissing, acid-dripping dragon from jaws to tail.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +7 (2d8) or 1 acid breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage. Organic material or metal hit dissolves on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Acidblood</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scale-Master</strong>. Reptiles and amphibians hearing dragon's commands, CHA 15+ or utterly charmed for 1d8 days.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
